    <name>Mount Kerkeslin Campground</name>
    <cmt>description: Open: May 29 to September 2, 2024&lt;br&gt; Reservable: All sites available on a First Come, First Served basis. No reservations possible.&lt;br&gt; Sites: 42&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; Fees: See full list of camping fees here&lt;br&gt; Site type:&lt;br&gt; Unserviced, with fire pit&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This shaded campground is an excellent stop-over for tenters and RVers looking for peace and quiet along the Icefields Parkway. Located along the Athabasca River, it is just a short drive from the iconic Athabasca Falls and only 34 km from the town of Jasper.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Best suited for tents as well asmotorhomes and trailers under 27 feet.&lt;br&gt;"&lt;br&gt;https://parks.canada.ca/pn-np/ab/jasper/activ/passez-stay/camping#kerkeslin&lt;br&gt;Type: National Park Campground&lt;br&gt;ID:</cmt>
